  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "How many hours can you provide daily? How many hours in a week?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": true,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 1
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Introduce yourself.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 1
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Can you play on Peak Hours? Especially after 6,7 pm BDT?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": true,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 2
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Why do you want to join PD?",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 2
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Explain about criminal character switching rules / Day off",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": true,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 3
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Give a situation of traffic stop and check how he reacts",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 3
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "You can't play as a Criminal Character in the cadet phase, Will you agree?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": true,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 4
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Ask about \"PD TRYHARD\"",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 4
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "You can't do PD rp in any other server",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": true,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 5
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "What is the meaning of Miranda Rights?",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 5
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Diff between RDM and VDM",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 6
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Give a situation and ask if he is gonna use his Taser/Pistol inside the Pillbox.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 6
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Powergaming with a suitable example",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 7
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Ask him about the DOJ and COURT CASE.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 7
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "What is in-game metagaming?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 8
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "Give some FTO ride-along situations and check how he responds.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 8
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Explain KOS ( kill on Sight )",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 9
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "What is the Chain of Command?",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 9
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Ask about character mixing and exploit",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 10
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "walkin",
    "item_text": "You can give more situations to them if you think it's necessary. In last, you will say your result will be posted in the interview result.",
    "item_type": "note",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 10
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Ask about the safe zones",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 11
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Ask if he/she will make the PD negotiator a hostage.",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 12
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "While processing, the suspect asked the officer to join support right now!!",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 13
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "What will you do if you see your favourite streamer? What will you do?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 14
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "If you use your power to abuse someone or break any rules you can be fired or get a ban. Will you agree?",
    "item_type": "bullet",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 15
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "interview",
    "section_id": "discord",
    "item_text": "Take as little time as possible, just ask him the question if he/she can't answer, skip, and move to the next question, you don't need to give hints.",
    "item_type": "note",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 16
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "sergeant",
    "section_id": "corporal",
    "item_text": "Mid Career Exam mandatory to pass to become Sergeant",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 1
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "sergeant",
    "section_id": "corporal",
    "item_text": "All the exam modules of the trooper exam may be repeated. But remember, during the trooper exam we sometimes overlook many mistakes. But in this case, we will expect flawless performance.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 2
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "sergeant",
    "section_id": "corporal",
    "item_text": "A speed test will be added to the practical exam. There will be a live 10.80. During this, the candidate must keep an eye on the vehicle. Examiners will pay close attention to the visual ratio.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 3
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "sergeant",
    "section_id": "corporal",
    "item_text": "You need to have a total grip on the Police Handbook and fair knowledge of the penal code of Legacy ( you will find it on Discord ).",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 4
  },
  {
    "doc_id": "sergeant",
    "section_id": "corporal",
    "item_text": "There will be a situational response test in the viva, where you will be asked your response in various police situations.",
    "item_type": "numbered",
    "is_important": false,
    "is_highlight": false,
    "sort_order": 5
  },
